<%# Plain fallback when AI is off or failing: the captain keeps working. %>
<% case fallback.to_s
   when "off" %>AI drafts are off. Add a provider key in Settings → AI assistance, or keep writing by hand.
<% when "opt_out" %>AI is off for this client. Turn it back on from their page to draft here.
<% when "over_cap" %>Today's AI cost cap is reached. Raise it in Settings → AI assistance, or keep writing by hand.
<% when "rate_limited" %>AI is busy — try again in a minute.
<% else %>AI could not finish just now. Try again, or keep writing by hand.
<% end %>
